  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amsterdam Cocoa Week &#x2013; Chocoa event</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to give exposure to the cocoa combi-tracks of C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire, during the Amsterdam Cocoa Week &#x2013; Chocoa event, and stimulate knowledge exchange and partnership between the different Dutch and local stakeholders (private companies, non-governmental organisations (NGOs), the Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO) and Netherlands embassies).Following last year&apos;s event, this event will dive deeper into the lessons learned and results from the past year presented by ETG and others. In addition, the focus will be on the overarching theme of contributing to a living income.In the end, the project will contribute to the sustainable development of the cocoa sector in C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire, hence creating new insights on small-scale local processing, including opportunities for local (youth) employment and business opportunities for Dutch products and services that can support this development.</narrative>
  </description>
